WEBVTT

00:38.040 --> 00:40.240
"Any day now, we're gonna be classmates."

00:41.040 --> 00:42.400
I really can't wait.

01:00.040 --> 01:04.120
Teenage love is forever frowned upon.

01:08.200 --> 01:11.440
Do adults forbid love
because they mean well?

01:14.240 --> 01:17.200
Or because they can't accept the truth?

02:56.560 --> 03:01.200
DRESS CODE FOR FEMALE STUDENTS
TIPNAREE WITTAYA SCHOOL

03:01.280 --> 03:05.400
CORRECT PROSTRATION POSTURE
TIPNAREE WITTAYA SCHOOL

03:10.520 --> 03:14.160
A VIRTUOUS LADY IS A NATIONAL TREASURE

03:14.240 --> 03:17.760
TIPNAREE WITTAYA SCHOOL

03:17.840 --> 03:21.240
We can't merge with the boys' school.
Just tell me what this is all about.

03:26.360 --> 03:31.600
We have no other choice, Miss Naruemol.
Our school is running at a loss.

03:32.640 --> 03:34.080
Our esteemed school…

03:34.160 --> 03:36.720
is acclaimed for producing
highly virtuous ladies.

03:36.800 --> 03:40.640
If you suddenly let those boys
swarm in here like pestering flies,

03:40.720 --> 03:43.240
they will tarnish
our school's fine reputation.

03:44.440 --> 03:45.960
We can keep our reputation,

03:46.480 --> 03:49.240
but I won't have the necessary funds
to pay you.

03:50.280 --> 03:51.560
Are you fine with that?

03:52.840 --> 03:55.120
These male students are like termites,
you know that.

03:55.680 --> 03:59.720
Once they start eating away our home,
they'll never ever stop.

04:00.880 --> 04:03.520
And that fine reputation
that we've established?

04:03.600 --> 04:06.360
It will all but crumble to the ground.

04:06.440 --> 04:08.960
Crumble to the ground?

04:11.360 --> 04:14.680
So are you saying these boys are termites
or are they flies?

04:19.400 --> 04:20.240
They're both.

04:20.720 --> 04:23.440
Just read what they're sending
to our girls.

04:24.080 --> 04:26.440
-Hmm.
-I can't bear it anymore.

04:28.560 --> 04:30.000
Oh.

04:31.400 --> 04:34.440
These boys are much more naive
than I had imagined.

04:35.040 --> 04:37.000
Do you know that back in my day,

04:37.560 --> 04:39.160
boys were far worse?

04:41.640 --> 04:43.560
Laugh all you want
but I will not allow this.

04:46.720 --> 04:49.120
I know you love this school very much,

04:50.200 --> 04:52.120
but you seem to have forgotten

04:52.200 --> 04:54.840
that I don't need your permission
to do anything.

04:56.680 --> 04:57.920
I called you here

04:58.520 --> 05:02.120
because as chief administrative officer
of the school,

05:02.200 --> 05:04.600
you'll come up with our policies

05:04.680 --> 05:07.080
to help prepare
our impressionable students

05:07.160 --> 05:10.320
for the transition about to take place.

05:14.720 --> 05:16.920
Our reputation might be tarnished,

05:17.000 --> 05:20.880
however, we'll earn the money needed
to keep the school running.

05:20.960 --> 05:22.040
Are we clear?

05:24.440 --> 05:29.800
I must say that I'm quite disappointed
by this decision of his.

05:30.520 --> 05:33.560
I mean, our principal
practically opened the gate

05:33.640 --> 05:35.920
for the enemy to take over our land.
Don't you think?

05:36.000 --> 05:37.040
Hmm…

05:37.120 --> 05:39.800
I actually don't think
it will do much harm at all.

05:39.880 --> 05:44.160
Our students will have to meet boys
eventually one way or another, you know.

05:44.240 --> 05:46.560
But this isn't the time in their life
to fight.

05:48.640 --> 05:51.880
These girls are incredibly delicate.

05:52.960 --> 05:56.560
They are like beautiful flowers
in their first bloom.

05:58.960 --> 06:03.000
We must provide them
utmost care and guidance.

06:04.160 --> 06:06.320
They're at a very vulnerable age.

06:07.320 --> 06:09.160
They're easily distracted.

06:09.960 --> 06:13.080
The boys are also
at quite a precarious age.

06:13.160 --> 06:16.680
They lack both maturity
and responsibility.

06:17.640 --> 06:19.400
It's risky, you know.

06:19.480 --> 06:22.880
We're putting our students at risk
of being demoralized.

06:22.960 --> 06:24.840
I agree with you, Naruemol.

06:25.360 --> 06:28.200
We must preserve our students' virtue
at all cost.

06:28.280 --> 06:30.680
If we can't agree
that this is a real problem,

06:30.760 --> 06:32.800
we'll never get through it alive.

06:35.040 --> 06:36.640
Well articulated, Linda.

06:38.040 --> 06:39.920
I've been here a long, long time.

06:40.000 --> 06:44.160
I'm well aware of the fine reputation
that our school has achieved.

06:46.640 --> 06:52.200
So, I'd like to volunteer as the leader
to help us get through this moral crisis.

06:52.760 --> 06:54.480
But we all must join the fight.

06:55.760 --> 06:59.040
I'll do all I can imposing policies…

06:59.920 --> 07:03.600
going the extra mile
until with the victors.

07:04.880 --> 07:06.080
And brave Linda…

07:07.200 --> 07:09.440
I'll need your might on the battlefield.

07:09.920 --> 07:11.400
It would be my honor.

07:12.560 --> 07:14.480
But we must begin right away.

07:14.560 --> 07:17.600
Because the students
are already talking about the merger.

07:18.720 --> 07:19.800
How awful.

07:20.560 --> 07:22.680
There hasn't even been
an official announcement yet.

07:23.480 --> 07:24.880
It's already getting out of control.

07:25.560 --> 07:27.440
Who would have leaked the news about this?

07:28.960 --> 07:29.840
Hey.

07:29.920 --> 07:32.320
I heard our school will merge
with the boys' school next door.

07:32.400 --> 07:35.120
-Is that true, Nanno?
-Yes.

07:35.200 --> 07:36.880
Will we have boys in our class?

07:36.960 --> 07:38.000
How will that work?

07:38.080 --> 07:40.400
I won't know how to carry myself.

07:40.480 --> 07:44.320
What will we do in gym class?
How will we manage?

07:44.400 --> 07:46.600
What if we have to work
on a report together at home?

07:46.680 --> 07:48.680
-Just the thought stresses me out.
-Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.

07:48.760 --> 07:51.800
There's nothing to worry about.
Boys are harmless.

07:52.440 --> 07:53.640
-Really?
-Hmm.

07:54.360 --> 07:56.960
Mm-hmm.
I went to a unisex school before.

07:57.480 --> 07:59.080
Boys aren't as scary as you think.

07:59.800 --> 08:01.120
How so?

08:01.200 --> 08:04.480
One time, a group of boys dared each other

08:04.560 --> 08:08.640
to slide down the stair's railing
while I was on the lookout for them.

08:09.160 --> 08:12.400
When a teacher showed up,
they all just ran away.

08:12.480 --> 08:14.080
It was fun.

08:14.160 --> 08:15.920
That's funny.

08:18.160 --> 08:20.640
TIPNAREE WITTAYA SCHOOL
RULE NUMBER ONE,

08:20.720 --> 08:22.640
GIRLS MUST NOT LAUGH
AT BOYS' LAME JOKES

08:22.720 --> 08:25.040
TO APPEAR LADYLIKE

08:25.120 --> 08:29.160
Have you guys ever heard what they say
about the girl's school uniform?

08:29.240 --> 08:30.400
Don't skirt me now.

08:32.200 --> 08:33.160
Here they come.

08:39.920 --> 08:43.840
So, hey there.
I'm Nanno. Nice to meet you.

08:44.320 --> 08:49.000
I'm Punjan. These are Pob, Man and Yong.

08:49.600 --> 08:52.520
These girls are Mind, Ploy and Khao.

08:53.920 --> 08:55.200
It's so nice to meet you.

08:56.120 --> 08:57.240
Hmm.

08:58.280 --> 09:00.640
How can they hear you
from all the way over there?

09:00.720 --> 09:02.000
Why don't you come closer?

09:03.560 --> 09:05.560
-Okay.
-These boys don't bite.

09:11.280 --> 09:13.680
I want to give you a tour
around the school,

09:13.760 --> 09:15.600
but I'm also the new kid here.

09:16.160 --> 09:17.880
I should let these girls do it.

09:17.960 --> 09:20.280
Huh?
I don't think that's appropriate, Nanno.

09:20.360 --> 09:23.080
But I remember
that a virtuous and well-mannered lady

09:23.160 --> 09:26.080
should always be kind towards others.

09:26.160 --> 09:28.720
-Mm-hmm.
-Am I right, Namnueng?

09:34.880 --> 09:36.520
Yeah. She's right.

09:43.000 --> 09:45.320
Come on. I'll show you guys around.

09:47.240 --> 09:48.480
Mm-hmm.

09:52.000 --> 09:53.680
This is the music room.

09:54.440 --> 09:57.040
So, if this is the Tipnaree music room…

09:57.960 --> 10:02.560
then I'm guessing there must be
a lyrics room somewhere else, right?

10:05.040 --> 10:07.520
You see, I told you that boys
are really funny.

10:08.960 --> 10:10.960
Oh.

10:12.120 --> 10:14.040
Nanno.

10:14.760 --> 10:16.520
Let's move on to the next room.

10:21.160 --> 10:23.160
This is the art room.

10:23.240 --> 10:24.800
-The art room?
-Yes.

10:24.880 --> 10:26.920
Is this where you do embroidery and stuff?

10:27.000 --> 10:29.800
No. That's home economics class.

10:29.880 --> 10:31.640
What about this room?

10:31.720 --> 10:34.960
This room? This is for girls only.

10:35.040 --> 10:37.040
-Boys aren't allowed.
-I want to see it.

10:37.600 --> 10:39.040
They stand so close.

10:39.600 --> 10:42.080
What should we do about this, Naruemol?

10:52.000 --> 10:53.760
I think I have just a way.

11:02.080 --> 11:06.520
Today is the day we welcome
the male students to our campus.

11:07.760 --> 11:10.960
To make sure all classes
run smoothly and on time,

11:11.840 --> 11:14.720
I'd like to inform you of one small rule.

11:15.800 --> 11:19.480
We'll implement the practice
of social distancing.

11:20.000 --> 11:23.160
Boys and girls must keep distance
from each other.

11:23.240 --> 11:25.040
Starting with the morning assembly,

11:25.120 --> 11:29.400
girl and boy students will be kept
in separate lines at all times.

11:29.960 --> 11:32.680
The girls will form a line
on the left side.

11:33.200 --> 11:35.960
The boys will form a line
on the right side.

11:36.600 --> 11:37.680
You may proceed.

11:47.880 --> 11:49.600
From now on,

11:49.680 --> 11:52.640
you will be put in separate classes.

11:52.720 --> 11:56.160
This isn't only to preserve
the purity of the girls.

11:57.040 --> 12:00.440
We'll also raise boys to be gentlemen.

12:07.800 --> 12:11.080
Run. Run faster. Run faster.

12:12.480 --> 12:14.040
Run faster. Come on.

12:21.440 --> 12:23.680
This is good for you.
Exercise is good for you.

12:23.760 --> 12:25.040
It will make you sweat.

12:25.120 --> 12:27.320
You must distract your obscene mind.

12:27.400 --> 12:28.360
Thank you so much.

12:32.400 --> 12:34.120
Chocolate has hereby been banned.

12:34.200 --> 12:37.960
It can stimulate sexual desires in men.

12:40.480 --> 12:43.960
TIPNAREE WITTAYA SCHOOL
RULE NUMBER TWO

12:44.040 --> 12:47.360
STUDENTS MUST SAY UHT DRINKS
OR PASTEURIZED DRINKS INSTEAD OF MILK.

12:48.440 --> 12:50.320
-I'm exhausted.
-I know.

12:53.120 --> 12:55.040
Don't you think this is a bit much?

12:56.000 --> 12:57.800
Well, kind of, yeah.

12:58.280 --> 13:00.640
I feel so bad for the boys.
Look at them.

13:00.720 --> 13:02.600
Their hands shake so much,
they can barely eat.

13:02.680 --> 13:04.200
Mm-hmm.

13:11.840 --> 13:14.560
I'm so tired.

13:15.080 --> 13:17.120
-Hmm?
-What's he saying?

13:17.200 --> 13:18.280
Mm-mmm.

13:27.520 --> 13:29.280
Pob says he's really tired.

13:30.800 --> 13:33.120
Hang on. Do you have his phone number?

13:33.800 --> 13:36.200
It's normal for friends
to exchange numbers.

13:36.680 --> 13:37.800
Ah.

13:37.880 --> 13:40.080
Would you like me to add you
to the group chat?

13:40.160 --> 13:42.640
-Mm-hmm.
-So you can talk to them too.

13:42.720 --> 13:44.560
-All right.
-Sounds good.

13:45.240 --> 13:46.160
Hmm.

13:49.800 --> 13:51.160
I added you to the group.

13:51.240 --> 13:52.640
-Accept my invite.
-Okay.

13:52.720 --> 13:54.360
MINT JOINED THE GROUP
POON JOINED THE GROUP

13:54.440 --> 13:56.600
MINT: ARE YOU EATING
ONLY VEGETABLES? POOR YOU.

13:56.680 --> 13:58.400
BALL: THEY ARE NUTRITIOUS.

13:58.480 --> 13:59.800
NANNO: DO YOU NEED MORE NUTRITION?

13:59.880 --> 14:01.240
BALL: CAN I HAVE YOUR MILK, THEN?

14:01.320 --> 14:02.840
NANNO: OKAY.

14:12.960 --> 14:15.840
BALL: THANK YOU.

14:16.360 --> 14:18.120
You know you can't use your phones
at lunch.

14:18.200 --> 14:19.640
Who are you talking to?

14:32.520 --> 14:33.640
What is this?

14:34.360 --> 14:36.160
"Take you, take you, take you."

14:36.240 --> 14:37.080
TAKE YOU

14:37.160 --> 14:38.360
"Take you"?

14:39.120 --> 14:42.400
I think you should look at the messages
more carefully.

14:44.160 --> 14:47.680
THANK YOU.

14:53.120 --> 14:54.440
BALL: CAN I HAVE YOUR MILK, THEN?

14:54.520 --> 14:55.760
Oh, my goodness.

14:55.840 --> 14:58.160
Oh, my goodness.

14:58.640 --> 15:00.200
He asked for your milk?

15:01.600 --> 15:05.840
He asked to have my box of milk.
What do you think he meant by that?

15:10.840 --> 15:12.280
Can I have your milk, then?

15:12.360 --> 15:13.320
Let's see.

15:17.560 --> 15:19.320
I'd love to try that.

15:24.000 --> 15:24.960
I must handle this.

15:25.040 --> 15:26.760
TIPNAREE WITTAYA SCHOOL
RULE NUMBER THREE,

15:26.840 --> 15:28.320
GIRLS AND BOYS CANNOT TEXT EACH OTHER.

15:28.400 --> 15:30.400
YOUR ACCOUNT WILL BE SUSPENDED
IF YOU GET CAUGHT.

15:37.240 --> 15:38.840
What's wrong with the internet?

16:29.520 --> 16:31.680
-Can I get one copy of the photo?
-Mm. Me too.

16:31.760 --> 16:33.280
Sure.

16:36.120 --> 16:37.920
-Gosh.
-Ah. Hey.

16:38.000 --> 16:38.960
It's so cold.

16:39.720 --> 16:43.240
So, have you thought about
what department you will apply for?

16:44.480 --> 16:45.640
Hmm…

16:46.440 --> 16:48.840
-I want to apply for Education.
-Mm.

16:48.920 --> 16:52.240
And after I graduate,
I wanna come back to teach here.

16:52.320 --> 16:54.000
Hmm? Right here?

16:54.080 --> 16:56.640
-Mm.
-Oh, wow.

16:57.600 --> 17:00.440
Then, I think Nareetip Wittaya School

17:00.960 --> 17:05.200
should maybe crown you
as their most generous alumni?

17:05.280 --> 17:07.600
Wow. Thank you.

17:09.360 --> 17:12.120
-I'm going to cry.
-Are you touched?

17:13.760 --> 17:14.840
Aren't I sweet?

17:14.920 --> 17:17.240
But I think you'll make a great teacher.

17:17.320 --> 17:18.440
THE EDUCATION OFFICE PRESENTS

17:18.520 --> 17:20.720
THE OUTSTANDING TEACHER AWARD
TO MS. NARUEMOL SRISIRIWIMOL

17:38.000 --> 17:42.000
THANK YOU, MISS LINDA.
THIS WORK MUST BE TAXING FOR YOU.

17:42.080 --> 17:45.040
ANYTHING FOR YOU, MISS NARUEMOL.

17:45.120 --> 17:48.440
I'LL PICK YOU UP
AT YOUR PLACE LIKE USUAL

17:52.960 --> 17:56.240
NAREETIP WITTAYA SCHOOL
RULE NUMBER FOUR

18:04.720 --> 18:06.960
Hey, are you still chatting with the boys?

18:07.040 --> 18:07.880
I am.

18:09.320 --> 18:12.440
But I thought your account
also got suspended.

18:13.080 --> 18:14.680
I have a new app now.

18:15.240 --> 18:18.640
-A new app now?
-Mm-hmm. The app True Love.

18:18.720 --> 18:20.680
It lets you talk to people at school
anonymously,

18:20.760 --> 18:22.640
so teachers can't tell
who we're talking to

18:22.720 --> 18:24.360
or see what you're saying to each other.

18:25.240 --> 18:30.080
You never know, maybe, you might find
a friend or even find a boyfriend.

18:30.840 --> 18:32.120
Hmm.

18:32.200 --> 18:35.720
So, I can just download it
and use it right away?

18:35.800 --> 18:39.160
That's right. You can download it
and get started.

18:40.240 --> 18:42.960
Amazing. I'm going to download it.

18:46.200 --> 18:47.440
ALIEN: WHO ARE YOU? GIVE ME A HINT.

18:47.520 --> 18:48.960
SWEET LEMON:
DID YOU JUST LOOK ME IN THE EYE?

18:49.040 --> 18:50.840
This is so exciting.

18:50.920 --> 18:52.800
Yeah.
I want to know who I'm talking to.

18:52.880 --> 18:54.880
SMILEY ELEPHANT:
ARE YOU MY JUNIOR OR SENIOR?

18:56.960 --> 18:58.680
This is way out of line.

18:59.720 --> 19:03.600
Did you introduce your friends
to this obscene platform?

19:03.680 --> 19:05.040
Obscene?

19:06.000 --> 19:07.480
What does that mean?

19:07.560 --> 19:10.200
This is a… a blind-dating app.

19:10.280 --> 19:12.240
It's a disgusting platform

19:12.320 --> 19:14.800
where you share private things
with strangers.

19:14.880 --> 19:17.960
A disgusting platform?
It's just a chat room.

19:18.440 --> 19:22.640
I think this app
lets us see people's inner beauty

19:22.720 --> 19:26.040
and it may help us to find a true friend.

19:26.560 --> 19:27.960
And who knows?

19:28.800 --> 19:31.240
We might even find true love on this app.

19:32.880 --> 19:34.400
What about you?

19:34.480 --> 19:37.200
Did you ever fall in love with someone
when you were in school?

19:37.280 --> 19:40.320
Watch it. Don't get nosy about my life.

19:41.360 --> 19:44.680
Kids your age
should focus on your studies.

19:45.160 --> 19:47.360
You should not be focusing
on finding love.

19:48.440 --> 19:50.040
Just take it from me.

19:50.120 --> 19:52.920
Love will bring you big trouble
and don't forget that.

19:54.280 --> 19:57.000
Some girls might lose their virginity.

19:57.760 --> 19:58.960
Some of you…

20:00.200 --> 20:02.080
might even get pregnant.

20:05.640 --> 20:06.880
I know that.

20:07.720 --> 20:09.360
If things get out of hand…

20:09.960 --> 20:12.880
students may do obscene things,
won't they?

20:13.960 --> 20:15.800
If you understand…

20:15.880 --> 20:18.480
you must delete that app this instant.

20:19.280 --> 20:20.480
Delete it?

20:21.320 --> 20:25.920
But I think this app
might be useful for the teachers.

20:26.400 --> 20:29.600
You can use it
to monitor the students here.

20:37.040 --> 20:38.160
What are you saying?

20:39.600 --> 20:42.520
Don't you think it's always better…

20:43.480 --> 20:44.960
to be the one in the know?

20:46.280 --> 20:51.360
I think you want as many students
as possible using this app.

20:52.240 --> 20:54.800
This app keeps users anonymous.

20:55.360 --> 20:57.000
But then again, you know,

20:57.080 --> 21:00.840
you have names, birth dates
and passwords of every student.

21:01.320 --> 21:05.080
You could use this app
to monitor everyone's conversations

21:05.160 --> 21:07.280
before they stray too far.

21:07.360 --> 21:08.680
No one will know.

21:09.360 --> 21:10.720
But it's up to you.

21:12.040 --> 21:13.040
Hmm…

21:13.120 --> 21:14.800
It's all up to you.

21:15.360 --> 21:17.560
Maybe you don't feel like
it's worth the risk.

21:18.360 --> 21:21.960
Maybe you're afraid
you'll get carried away.

21:25.080 --> 21:28.320
But don't worry,
you'll just be chatting over text.

21:28.400 --> 21:30.160
No one will get pregnant.

21:33.160 --> 21:34.200
You're right.

21:36.400 --> 21:38.760
Please set up an account for me?

21:52.560 --> 21:55.160
EMPTY VASE

22:12.280 --> 22:15.760
EMPTY VASE:
I GET DISHEARTENED SOMETIMES

22:15.840 --> 22:19.240
THAT NO ONE APPRECIATES MY HARD WORK.

22:19.320 --> 22:23.600
DAFFODIL: I GET IT.
YOU JUST WANT TO BE APPRECIATED.

22:33.200 --> 22:37.200
EMPTY VASE: IT'S LIKE I'M FIGHTING ALONE
WITH NO ONE BY MY SIDE.

22:37.280 --> 22:42.600
DAFFODIL: PLEASE KNOW THAT
AT LEAST YOU HAVE ME.

22:55.280 --> 22:56.320
Ruethai.

22:59.080 --> 23:00.680
I spent ages looking for you.

23:02.440 --> 23:03.600
What is wrong, Ruethai?

23:10.240 --> 23:11.960
You can tell me anything.

23:13.480 --> 23:15.120
You know you're my best friend.

23:16.120 --> 23:18.040
I can do anything for you, Ruethai.

23:21.960 --> 23:22.960
Hmm.

23:26.440 --> 23:28.920
I really wish I had a boyfriend like you.

23:30.560 --> 23:31.640
Of course, Ruethai.

23:31.720 --> 23:33.800
-I can be anything for--
-Ruethai.

23:38.440 --> 23:39.400
Forgive me.

23:42.040 --> 23:42.920
I was wrong.

23:45.360 --> 23:46.880
Please give me another chance.

24:18.920 --> 24:24.280
NAREETIP WITTAYA SCHOOL
RULE NUMBER FIVE, CHANGE OF RULE

24:24.360 --> 24:27.520
Here are the names of students
having dirty conversations.

24:30.720 --> 24:32.320
Dear students,

24:32.400 --> 24:35.840
unfortunately, we've discovered
that some of you

24:35.920 --> 24:39.800
are acting in defiance
of our school's rules.

24:40.560 --> 24:45.120
I have no choice but to impose
even stricter rules upon us.

24:46.120 --> 24:48.760
I'm doing this for your own well-being.

24:49.240 --> 24:54.440
From now on, female students
attend classes in this building.

24:55.160 --> 24:58.960
And male students will take their classes
over there.

25:06.960 --> 25:09.000
And for some of you who are here…

25:10.040 --> 25:13.640
we'll be taking your phones away
immediately.

25:13.720 --> 25:16.840
Teachers, you may proceed.

25:33.440 --> 25:37.000
Hey, you two. Can you keep
your distance from each other?

25:38.440 --> 25:41.920
Otherwise, I'll have boys and girls
use separate hallways.

25:55.280 --> 25:58.080
-Good afternoon, Miss.
-Good afternoon.

26:05.920 --> 26:07.080
Hello there.

26:07.640 --> 26:11.040
I was worried that you might be tired
so I brought you something to drink.

26:20.560 --> 26:22.040
Why are you following me?

26:23.320 --> 26:26.400
How's it going? Did your plan to spy
on the students work?

26:32.480 --> 26:37.520
When I read what students text each other,
I can feel myself start to blush.

26:37.600 --> 26:39.840
I don't know.
Do you feel the same way too?

26:41.040 --> 26:44.240
There's nothing interesting about it.
It's all nonsense.

26:45.320 --> 26:46.480
I know, right?

26:47.480 --> 26:48.960
It's a real shame, though.

26:49.040 --> 26:53.080
Everyone's starting to suspect
that you are also using the app.

26:54.240 --> 26:56.280
I don't care much about that silly app.

26:56.960 --> 26:58.880
I just need to find a way

26:59.400 --> 27:02.200
to keep boy and girl students
away from each other.

27:03.080 --> 27:04.920
I'm sure you'll find a way.

27:15.600 --> 27:16.880
Excuse me.

27:16.960 --> 27:20.960
I think I heard some weird noises
coming from that room over there.

27:31.120 --> 27:33.040
-Ah. Oh. Huh?
-Huh?

27:33.680 --> 27:34.640
Hey!

27:34.720 --> 27:36.880
What are you two doing?

27:36.960 --> 27:39.080
-What are you doing? What are you doing?
-It's not what you think.

27:39.160 --> 27:40.600
Stop it.

27:40.680 --> 27:43.200
Didn't I tell you
to stay away from each other?

27:55.280 --> 27:56.960
Let's go, Punjan.

28:19.520 --> 28:21.800
I have some bad news to tell you.

28:22.480 --> 28:24.360
Ruethai isn't with us anymore.

28:24.960 --> 28:27.680
She had an abortion
and lost too much blood.

28:29.240 --> 28:31.800
The doctor couldn't save
her precious life.

28:32.760 --> 28:35.040
I'm sorry to say, she's dead.

29:05.880 --> 29:08.760
Do you have anything
to say for yourself, Miss Naruemol?

29:08.840 --> 29:13.240
I was trying to prevent horrible things
from happening to both of my students.

29:13.320 --> 29:16.120
They have no idea
what could happen to them.

29:16.800 --> 29:17.880
This happened.

29:22.040 --> 29:25.360
Punjan and Namnueng
were apparently studying together.

29:25.440 --> 29:29.840
They dropped this eraser on the floor,
so Namnueng bent down to pick it up.

29:31.760 --> 29:33.240
Do you honestly believe them?

29:34.280 --> 29:36.000
I wasn't there, so I don't know.

29:37.320 --> 29:42.640
What I do know is, Punjan got ten stitches
for the cut on his head

29:42.720 --> 29:44.920
and his parents may very well sue us.

29:48.800 --> 29:49.840
Miss Naruemol…

29:50.960 --> 29:52.520
for the sake of our school…

29:53.040 --> 29:54.800
I have no choice but to fire you.

29:55.560 --> 29:56.600
What did you say?

29:58.040 --> 30:00.800
I'll help clear up the problem
you've caused,

30:01.480 --> 30:04.600
but I must ask you
to leave the school immediately.

30:05.760 --> 30:08.200
What will become of this school
if I leave?

30:08.680 --> 30:11.760
We will go back to being
a straightforward unisex school

30:11.840 --> 30:13.600
like it was supposed to be.

31:10.680 --> 31:12.400
DAFFODIL: DON'T FORGET THAT
A VASE MAKES A FLOWER LOOK PRETTIER.

31:12.480 --> 31:13.360
EMPTY VASE:
I GET DISHEARTENED SOMETIMES

31:13.440 --> 31:14.320
THAT NO ONE APPRECIATES MY HARD WORK.

31:14.400 --> 31:15.360
DAFFODIL: PLEASE KNOW THAT
AT LEAST YOU HAVE ME.

31:15.440 --> 31:17.560
DAFFODIL: I GET IT.
YOU JUST WANT TO BE APPRECIATED.

31:17.640 --> 31:23.600
EMPTY VASE: IT'S LIKE I'M FIGHTING ALONE
WITH NO ONE BY MY SIDE.

31:30.040 --> 31:32.520
Attention, students.

31:32.600 --> 31:36.360
This morning, I've asked Miss Naruemol…

31:36.840 --> 31:39.840
to come say goodbye before she leaves us.

31:41.680 --> 31:44.240
Therefore, I'd like you
to pay close attention.

31:45.880 --> 31:48.160
Miss Naruemol has been a teacher here
for a long time

31:48.240 --> 31:49.960
and was a student here herself.

31:51.960 --> 31:56.200
I'm sure she has some words of wisdom
to share with you all.

31:58.120 --> 31:59.520
The stage is yours, Miss.

32:00.360 --> 32:01.480
Thank you so much.

32:04.920 --> 32:06.280
Dear students…

32:07.880 --> 32:12.120
our school is currently undergoing
quite a few changes.

32:13.200 --> 32:15.160
I'd like every female student…

32:16.040 --> 32:19.400
to maintain your virtue and chastity.

32:20.080 --> 32:23.720
As for the male students,
please keep your distance from the girls.

32:24.680 --> 32:26.280
Once you're out in the world…

32:27.080 --> 32:30.720
you will all be happy and safe.

32:45.000 --> 32:46.240
Students.

32:48.440 --> 32:50.320
When the right time comes,

32:50.400 --> 32:55.120
you will all find so much happiness
in having a family, a family of your own.

32:55.720 --> 33:00.280
I want you all
to maintain your virtue and chastity.

33:00.360 --> 33:01.480
Are you listening to me?

33:11.800 --> 33:12.720
Empty Vase.

33:13.280 --> 33:14.480
Daffodil.

33:18.160 --> 33:19.600
I get everything now.

33:21.560 --> 33:22.640
What do you get?

33:23.600 --> 33:25.880
I don't just look up to you.

33:26.920 --> 33:29.160
I think I'm actually in love with you.

33:29.880 --> 33:30.960
Love me?

33:33.520 --> 33:34.880
I have feelings for you.

33:37.120 --> 33:39.160
That's obscene.

33:40.040 --> 33:41.440
We're both women.

33:41.960 --> 33:44.520
Love is the warm feeling
that fills up your heart.

33:45.120 --> 33:49.000
You feel joy
when you're near the person you love.

33:49.080 --> 33:52.760
Do you know that my heart feels warm
every time I'm near you?

33:53.600 --> 33:56.960
What about you?
Do you feel the same way about me?

33:58.040 --> 33:59.680
You're my very best friend.

34:01.120 --> 34:03.080
I would do anything for you.

34:06.800 --> 34:10.400
Naruemol, please open your heart to love.

34:10.480 --> 34:14.240
Love is never wrong.
It's people who make it so.

34:27.600 --> 34:31.880
No matter what form love takes,
isn't it still love, Naruemol?

34:32.520 --> 34:37.840
I know you feel disheartened
that no one sees how hard you work.

34:39.520 --> 34:41.240
But I see it. I do.

34:42.960 --> 34:44.600
It's like I'm fighting alone…

34:45.480 --> 34:47.120
with no one by my side.

34:48.200 --> 34:49.560
Please know that…

34:50.480 --> 34:52.760
you have me right here with you.
